\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces The budget assembled: eight axes ordered by how much they move a reported association. Every effect is measured on the same cohort with everything else held fixed, so the rows are comparable with each other and with the within-region effect these models report (+0.056 to +0.153 ROC-AUC, interval about $\pm $0.010 wide at 1 km blocking). The final column marks the axes whose relevance a reader can settle from their own inputs before fitting anything.}}{21}{}\protected@file@percent }
